OL,3,GNEWSAPlans approved for dog swimming
OL,4,Apool
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning permission has been granted
OL,7,Ffor a swimming pool for dogs in
OL,8,FBarton-Upon-Humber.
OL,10,FThe Doggy Paddle Club, on Brigg Road,
OL,11,Fwill feature an indoor heated pool for
OL,12,Fdogs of all breeds and abilities, as
OL,13,Fwell as an indoor activity centre.
OL,15,FNorth Lincolnshire Council approved the
OL,16,Fplans to change the use of a commercial
OL,17,Funit, subject to conditions to manage
OL,18,Fnoise levels. Permission was also
OL,19,Fgranted for a new entrance and window
OL,20,Farrangement.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
