OL,3,GNEWSAPlans approved for dog swimming
OL,4,Apool
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe conditions include pre-booked
OL,7,Fappointments only and a maximum of six
OL,8,Fdogs being allowed on site at any time.
OL,9,FAn opening date is yet to be announced.
